29.text:
(1) There shall be a Director of Criminal Investigations who shall be appointed in accordance with section 30.
(2) Deleted by Act No. 19 of 2014, s. 90. (3) Deleted by Act No. 19 of 2014, s. 90. (4) The Commission shall appoint the Director on such terms and conditions as the Commission may determine. (5) A person shall be qualified for appointment as the Director of Criminal Investigations if the person —
  (a) is a citizen of Kenya;
